      444   ASSIGN
      445          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      446          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      447   ASSIGN
      448          b-slt-vat:NUM-LOCKED-COLUMNS IN FRAME Dialog-Frame     = 2.
      449   ASSIGN
      450          b-slt-vat-cons:NUM-LOCKED-COLUMNS IN FRAME Dialog-Frame     = 3.
